        <activityName xml:lang="en">EV charger, level 3, with pantograph, 450 kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: EV charger, level 3, with pantograph, 450 kW
 The total mass is from AAB's 450 kW pantograph charger (1340 kg x 3), plus the charging interface (500 kg). But the material composition, etc., is extrapolated from the Level-2 charger of Nansai et al, 2001. Assumed lifetime of 24 years. Original source: https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0 and ABB. UUID: f270e9a0-2883-3367-a9d9-c8d6e2ac4217
Location: Unspecified
Technology: The total mass is from AAB's 450 kW pantograph charger (1340 kg x 3), plus the charging interface (500 kg). But the material composition, etc., is extrapolated from the Level-2 charger of Nansai et al, 2001. Assumed lifetime of 24 years. Original source: https://doi.org/10.1016/S0306-2619(01)00032-0 and ABB
Time period: Base technology year of 2020
