Uncertainty adjustments: Unspecified
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f270e9a0-2883-3367-a9d9-c8d6e2ac4217.xml</text>
